<h1>Use Last Settings</h1>
<hr align="center" size="5" class="whs3">
<p><span class="Command">T</span>his command is accessible from the <span class="Path">menu</span> <span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>3D Inspection &gt; Use Last Settings</b></span>.</p>
<p class="Description"><span class="Command" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> <span class="Command">Use Last Settings</span> <span lang="EN-GB">function enters a new session of existing i</span>nspection using the same reference and a new entity to inspect<span lang="EN-GB">.</span></p>
<p class="Use"><span lang="EN-GB">It is useful for multiple offline inspections. For example, we have scanned 10 details of a flow production and we want to compare them all to the original CAD model. The procedure will be reduced to a single new inspection of the first scan data to the CAD model, followed by 9 comparison by template for the rest of the details. The advantage of this function is that all inspection settings (ranges, labels, etc.) are kept during the initial session, then these are applied to all other sessions without additional adjustment.</span></p>
<p class="Note" id="P1"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Note</b></span><span lang="EN-GB">: If you don't have saved inspection in the current document or if you have deleted the last reference, then the function</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Use Last Settings</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">is not enabled.</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Go to</span> <b><span class="Path">3D Inspection &gt; Use Last Settings</span> to enter inspection mode. The function works on selection or on entirely selected entity using the reference of the former inspection.</b> If no selection is made, the following warning will appear:</p>
<p><img src="../images/CompareTpt_warning.gif" width="284px" height="126px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
<p>Choose one or more entities to compare and confirm:</p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">New inspection session using the last saved template will be loaded.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">All inspection elements (pages, labels, etc.) will be kept.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">All values will be recalculated and colour plot updated.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>For more details see</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB"><a href="../inspection_interface.htm">Inspection Interface</a>.</span></p>

